@startuml
title SLE-3 Level 3 - Component Diagram\nLinear Search Engine

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "LINEAR SEARCH ENGINE" {

    rectangle "Initialize Index" as Init

    rectangle "Compare Target\nwith Current Element" as Compare

    rectangle "Move to Next Index" as Next

    rectangle "Check End of List" as Check

    rectangle "Return Search Result" as Result
}

Init --> Compare : Start at index 0

Compare --> Result : Target found
Compare --> Next : Target not found

Next --> Check : Next index

Check --> Compare : More elements
Check --> Result : End of list

@enduml